2:T747,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a kitchen installation cost in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, labour and associated installation work may typically cost around £3,000 to £7,000, excluding the kitchen itself. Larger or more complex projects can cost considerably more. Every project differs, so request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does it cost to fit a kitchen without buying the units?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, a standard installation may typically cost roughly £2,000 to £6,000 for labour, depending on the room size, layout, worktops, appliances and whether plumbing or electrical work is needed. Every project differs, so request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is plumbing included in a kitchen fitting quote?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Some quotes include basic connections, while others price plumbing separately. Confirm whether the quote covers moving pipes, connecting appliances, waste disposal and making good."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I compare kitchen fitter quotes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Give each installer the same specification and compare the written scope, VAT, labour, materials, waste removal, appliance connections, finishing work, exclusions and variation process."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the most expensive part of a kitchen installation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The largest costs are often the kitchen units and worktops, followed by labour. Relocating plumbing or electrics, premium appliances and extensive flooring or decorating can also have a substantial effect."}}]}7:["slug","kitchen-installation-cost-uk","d"]
9:T4d5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HomeAndConstructionBusiness","name":"BMB Renovation","url":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk","logo":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/favicon.svg","image":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/og-image.png","description":"BMB Renovation offers premium home, kitchen & bathroom renovation services in Watford, London & Hertfordshire. 15+ years of experience. Free consultation.","telephone":"+447775758717","email":"contact@bmbrenovation.co.uk","priceRange":"££","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"157 Judge Street","addressLocality":"Watford","postalCode":"WD24 5AN","addressRegion":"Hertfordshire","addressCountry":"GB"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":51.6549,"longitude":-0.3978},"areaServed":["Watford","Bushey","Rickmansworth","St Albans","Hemel Hempstead","Borehamwood","Harrow","Croxley Green","Luton","Bedford","London"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"},{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":"Saturday","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/bmbrenovation","https://www.instagram.com/bmbrenovation"]}0:["1-yDqiOoRlcD5JvFDlrGO",[[["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","kitchen-installation-cost-uk","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"kitchen-installation-cost-uk\"}",{}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","kitchen-installation-cost-uk","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen flex flex-col","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Kitchen Installation Cost UK: Full Price Breakdown\",\"description\":\"Kitchen installation cost UK explained, including units, labour, plumbing, electrics and finishing work, with practical ti