e":"lucide lucide-house w-3.5 h-3.5","children":[["$","path","5wwlr5",{"d":"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"}],["$","path","1d0kgt",{"d":"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"}],"$undefined"]}]," Home"]}],["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3","children":[["$","path","mthhwq",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"hover:text-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"Blog"}],["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3","children":[["$","path","mthhwq",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/80 truncate max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-none","children":"Kitchen Installation Cost UK: Full Price Breakdown"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-[#C8A97E] text-xs mb-4","children":"kitchen installation cost uk"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight","children":"Kitchen Installation Cost UK: Full Price Breakdown"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-white/50 text-sm mt-5","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-calendar w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","rect","1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"3 August 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If you are budgeting for a new kitchen, the installation cost can be difficult to judge from online prices alone. A flat-pack kitchen may appear affordable, but the final bill can also include cabinet assembly, worktop fitting, plumbing, electrics, flooring, tiling, decorating and waste removal. As a rough guide, a straightforward UK kitchen installation may typically cost around £3,000 to £7,000 for labour and associated work, excluding the kitchen itself. A larger or more complex project can take the overall budget well beyond £15,000. Every project is different, so the most useful figure is based on your room, chosen materials and the extent of the changes; request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What is included in kitchen installation cost?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The phrase kitchen installation covers more than putting units in place. A typical quote may include removing the existing kitchen, preparing the room, assembling and securing cabinets, fitting doors and drawers, installing worktops, connecting appliances and carrying out final adjustments. If the layout changes, the work may also involve moving water and waste pipes, altering electrical circuits, adding lighting or repairing walls and floors. Ask whether prices include VAT, delivery, disposal of the old kitchen and making good after the trades have finished. These details can make two apparently similar quotes differ significantly."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Kitchen units and panels: as a rough guide, typically £1,500 to £8,000 or more, depending on size, supplier, specification and whether the units are flat-pack, rigid or bespoke."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktops: as a rough guide, typically £500 to £4,000, with laminate usually at the lower end and natural stone, quartz or other premium materials costing more."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Installation labour: as a rough guide, typically £2,000 to £6,000 for a standard room, although complicated layouts, large kitchens and extensive preparation can increase this."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removal and disposal: as a rough guide, this may typically cost several hundred pounds, depending on the amount of cabinetry, appliances and waste."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Appliances, sink and taps: as a rough guide, typically from around £1,000 for a basic selection, with integrated, premium or multiple appliances increasing the total. Every project differs, so request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Typical labour costs for fitting a kitchen"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Labour is often quoted as a fixed project price rather than a simple daily rate. This can be helpful because the cost is linked to the agreed scope, but the quote should still explain what the labour covers. Cabinet installation, worktop cutting, appliance integration and final adjustments each require different levels of time and care. A small replacement kitchen with the same layout may take considerably less work than a renovation involving new flooring, wall repairs and relocated services. If the installer needs to return after another contractor, that may also affect the programme and cost."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Plumbing and electrical work"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plumbing: as a rough guide, typically £300 to £1,500 for connecting or relocating a sink, dishwasher, washing machine and other water-fed appliances. Moving pipework further across the room can add preparation and repair work."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Electrical work: as a rough guide, a modest installation may typically cost around £500 to £2,000, while additional sockets, new lighting, an appliance circuit or wider alterations can increase the figure."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Gas appliance connections: if a gas hob or cooker is involved, confirm exactly what is included and use an appropriately qualified professional for that work."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Making good: chasing walls, repairing plaster, filling gaps and repainting after services have moved may be priced separately. Every project differs, so request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How the kitchen itself affects the price"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The number of units is only one part of the calculation. A simple single-wall kitchen generally needs less worktop, fewer corner cabinets and less installation time than a U-shaped design with an island. Tall housings, deep drawers, larder units, internal storage, bespoke panels and integrated appliances also add materials and fitting time. Worktop material is another major choice: laminate is usually the most economical, while timber, quartz, granite and other solid surfaces require different fabrication and installation arrangements. Handles, hinges, drawer runners and cabinet interiors can all affect the final specification."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Finishing work that is easy to overlook"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Flooring, skirting boards and threshold adjustments"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Wall tiling or a splashback, including adhesive, grout and trims"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plaster repairs and preparation around removed cabinets"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Painting and decorating, particularly where the old layout has left exposed or uneven areas"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Lighting, extractor installation and finishing around sockets"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Delivery, protection of existing areas, cleaning and removal of packaging"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to compare kitchen installation quotes fairly"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The cheapest quote is not necessarily the lowest final cost. Start by giving each contractor the same plans, appliance list and specification, then compare the detail line by line. Look for allowances described as provisional sums, because the eventual price may change when the exact material or amount of work is known. Confirm whether the quote covers removal, waste, delivery, worktop templating and cut-outs, appliance connections, plumbing alterations, electrics, tiling, flooring and decorating. It is also sensible to ask how variations will be priced and approved before extra work begins."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For homeowners in Hertfordshire, North London and Bedfordshire, a local contractor may be able to coordinate several parts of the project rather than leaving you to organise separate trades. BMB Renovation provides kitchen fitting and renovation, with plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation work handled in-house. The company serves Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead, Borehamwood, Harrow, Croxley Green, Luton and Bedford. You can review the ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-renovation-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen renovation service in Watford"}]," or see the wider range of ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/services","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"renovation services"}]," before requesting a ",["$","$L4","2",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"free, no-obligation quote"}],"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Ways to keep installation costs under control"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Keep the sink, dishwasher and cooker close to their existing positions if the current layout works well."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Choose the kitchen and appliances before final pricing, rather than relying on broad allowances."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Use standard cabinet sizes where possible; unusual dimensions often require infill panels or bespoke work."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Decide early whether you need new flooring, tiling, lighting or decorating so these costs are not added unexpectedly."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Keep a contingency in the budget for hidden problems such as damaged walls, uneven floors or outdated services."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Request a written scope of work, payment schedule and variation process before work starts."]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] t